    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lone Voyage you are left to scavenge the remnants of a dying galaxy in order to survive. You must manage your resources to keep your ship running. mine asteroid fields and dwarf planets for resources, loot abandoned ships and space stations, and upgrade your ships weapons and defenses in preparation for the swarm. a powerful and enigmatic race of self replicating machines with seemingly one purpose, the extermination of all life in the universe.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is yours and yours alone to explore. every sector has unique resources to collect and hazards to adapt too. To survive you must explore but don't stay in one place for too long. The swarm is always searching\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm Your Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lone Voyage features a variety of weapons and upgrades each fulfilling there own unique purpose. Early Access will start with 4 weapons with at least 12 completely unique weapons coming to the full version. Customize your ship with countless combinations of weapons and upgrades to create your perfect engine of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.poster.avif?t=1744157326\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.webm?t=1744157326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.mp4?t=1744157326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer the unending questions of the cosmos. Search through the remnants of humanity for clues. Discover what lead to humanities ruin. and perhaps even put a stop to the swarms eternal quest for &quot;order&quot; in the universe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lone Voyage you are left to scavenge the remnants of a dying galaxy in order to survive. You must manage your resources to keep your ship running. mine asteroid fields and dwarf planets for resources, loot abandoned ships and space stations, and upgrade your ships weapons and defenses in preparation for the swarm. a powerful and enigmatic race of self replicating machines with seemingly one purpose, the extermination of all life in the universe.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is yours and yours alone to explore. every sector has unique resources to collect and hazards to adapt too. To survive you must explore but don't stay in one place for too long. The swarm is always searching\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arm Your Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lone Voyage features a variety of weapons and upgrades each fulfilling there own unique purpose. Early Access will start with 4 weapons with at least 12 completely unique weapons coming to the full version. Customize your ship with countless combinations of weapons and upgrades to create your perfect engine of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.poster.avif?t=1744157326\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.webm?t=1744157326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624880/extras/3ccfb69a552ec974e1726bc8a48eb4ed.mp4?t=1744157326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer the unending questions of the cosmos. Search through the remnants of humanity for clues. Discover what lead to humanities ruin. and perhaps even put a stop to the swarms eternal quest for &quot;order&quot; in the universe.</p>",
